      "text": "```\nATUM (or Ra-Atum, Ra) — the self-created first god\n  Creator; self-generated from the primordial waters Nun\n  Masturbation myth: Atum produces Shu and Tefnut from himself\n  (some versions: spits them out; others: masturbation)\n  Solar deity: the setting sun as old man; midday as Ra-Horakhty"
    },
